  "statuteText": "420-J:14 Penalties. –\n\nAny health carrier or other organization violating any of the provisions of this chapter may be subject to an administrative fine not to exceed $2,500 per violation. The commissioner may also suspend or revoke the certificate of authority or license of a health carrier or other organization for any violation of this chapter or the failure to comply with an order of the commissioner issued under this chapter."
